# GDHelper Extension — AI Agent Rules

> Read `RULES.md`, `AGENT.md` and `PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md` in the project root for the full design system, component standards, and development guidelines before making any changes.

## Quick Reference

### Design: White + Green (GreenData theme)
- Tokens: CSS variables `--gd-*` in `src/index.css`; Tailwind `gd-*` colors reference them
- Page background is set on `body` — don't override it on root containers
- Cards: `bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm`
- Accent: `--gd-green` = emerald-600; neutral scale: `slate-*` only
- NEVER use dark backgrounds (`bg-slate-700+`, `bg-gray-*`, `bg-zinc-*`), even for code blocks
- NEVER use `rounded-2xl` or `rounded-3xl` for cards — ONLY `rounded-xl`
- Tailwind **v3** only: no `py-0.2`, `pl-8.5`, `animate-in` etc. (`shadow-xs`/`shadow-2xs` are defined in config)

### Component Reuse (MANDATORY)
- Text buttons → `<Button>` from `src/components/ui/Button.tsx`
- Icon buttons → `<IconButton>` or CSS class `.icon-btn` (+ `.icon-btn--danger`, `.vk-icon-*`)
- Cards / toolbars → `<Card>` / `<Toolbar>`; textarea / select → `<Textarea>` / `<Select>`
- Badges → `<Badge>` from `src/components/ui/Badge.tsx`
- Text inputs → `<Input>` from `src/components/ui/Input.tsx`
- Modals → `<Modal>` from `src/components/ui/Modal.tsx`

### Spacing & Layout
- Gap between card sections: `space-y-3`
- Card padding: `p-3`
- Toolbar padding: `p-1.5`
- Row items: `p-2.5 bg-slate-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-50/30 border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-300 rounded-xl`

### Icons
- Components & Navigation: `lucide-react`
- All icon buttons MUST animate on hover (`.icon-btn` handles this)

### Types
- All interfaces in `src/types/index.ts` — never duplicate
- Use `React.FC<Props>`, no `any`; `catch` errors → `getErrorMessage()` from `src/utils/errorUtils.ts`

### Language
- UI text: Russian; numerals via `pluralizeRu()` from `src/utils/pluralize.ts`
- Code identifiers: English
- Commits: English (`type: description`)

### Before commit
- Run `npm run build` (must pass with no errors)
- Update `PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md` changelog
- Windows PowerShell: use `;` not `&&` to chain commands
